"sanduka!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/006_two_goats_for_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Two goats! Listen to them bleat. They will give us milk and cheese, and eat the hay of the meadow."
