#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Viking bread was flat and baked on hot stones; honey made it a treat."
msgstr "Vikinški hljeb bio je plosnat i pečen na vrućem kamenju; s medom je bio poslastica."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Chieftain's Feast"
msgstr "Poglavičina gozba"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My daughter Thora turns twelve! A feast with the whole valley: bring me three crates of mead and "
"two of cheese, within three days."
msgstr ""
"Moja kći Thora puni dvanaest godina! Gozba za cijelu dolinu: {crew|donesi|donesi|donesite} mi tri "
"sanduka medovine i dva sira, u roku od tri dana."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The mead! The skalds will sing."
msgstr "Medovina! Skaldi će pjevati."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cheese, mead, songs and a fire! Come in, sit by me: it is the best birthday ever."
msgstr ""
"Sir, medovina, pjesme i vatra! {crew|Uđi|Uđi|Uđite}, {crew|sjedni|sjedni|sjednite} kraj mene: ovo "
"je najbolji rođendan ikad."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A chieftain's hall had a long fire in the middle, and benches along the walls."
msgstr "Poglavičina dvorana imala je dugu vatru u sredini i klupe uz zidove."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Ferryman's Tale"
msgstr "Prevoznikova priča"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Old Halvard told a story here last night: a hidden cove, where the swans of the lakes are born. He"
" says: ask the potter, the miller and the old man of Svanetorp."
msgstr ""
"Stari Halvard je sinoć ovdje pričao priču: o skrivenoj uvali gdje se rađaju labudovi s jezera. "
"Kaže: {crew|pitaj|pitaj|pitajte} lončaricu, mlinaricu i starca iz Svanetorpa."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The cove? My grandmother said: it lies where the reeds grow tallest. Ask Astrid."
msgstr ""
"Uvala? Moja baka je govorila: leži tamo gdje trska raste najviša. {crew|Pitaj|Pitaj|Pitajte} "
"Astrid."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Reeds? The tallest ones grow south, by Svanetorp. Go to Grim."
msgstr "Trska? Najviša raste na jugu, kraj Svanetorpa. {crew|Idi|Idi|Idite} do Grima."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"So you found my secret. Behind my farm, in the reeds: the swan cove. Look, the cygnets! Grey and "
"fluffy. Tell no one!"
msgstr ""
"Dakle, {crew|otkrio si|otkrila si|otkrili ste|otkrile ste} moju tajnu. Iza mog imanja, u trsci: "
"labudova uvala. Gle, labudići! Sivi i pahuljasti. Nikome ni riječi!"

#. a gift for a task: 'You get ...'
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "the secret of the swan cove"
msgstr "tajna labudove uvale"

