msgid "linen shirts"
msgstr ""

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/036_flax_in_the_field/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Flax was soaked, beaten and combed for weeks before it could be spun into linen."
msgstr "Lan se sedmicama močio, tukao i češljao prije nego što se mogao presti u platno."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/037_barley_for_the_brewer/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Barley for the Brewer"
msgstr "Ječam za pivara"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/037_barley_for_the_brewer/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Orm of Hallvik wants the biggest barrel of ale for the autumn feast. I need grain, five crates! "
"Bring them, and you get two crates of my ale."
msgstr ""
"Orm iz Hallvika želi najveću bačvu piva za jesensku gozbu. Treba mi žito, pet sanduka! "
"{crew|Donesi|Donesi|Donesite} ih, a ja ću {crew|ti|ti|vam} dati dva sanduka svog piva."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/037_barley_for_the_brewer/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Into the water with it, let it sprout... In a week, the best ale of the lakes!"
msgstr "U vodu s njim, neka proklija... Za sedmicu dana, najbolje pivo na jezerima!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/037_barley_for_the_brewer/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ale was brewed from barley and water, often with herbs instead of hops."
msgstr "Pivo se pravilo od ječma i vode, često s biljem umjesto hmelja."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/038_a_proper_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A Proper Hold"
msgstr "Pravo spremište"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/038_a_proper_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You are real traders now: you need a real hold! Bring me eight planks from Frosttorp and two "
"crates of iron tools, and pay 20 silver. Then your hold takes two more crates."
msgstr ""
"Sad {crew|si pravi trgovac|si prava trgovkinja|ste pravi trgovci|ste prave trgovkinje}: treba "
"{crew|ti|ti|vam} pravo spremište! {crew|Donesi|Donesi|Donesite} mi osam dasaka iz Frosttorpa i dva"
" sanduka alata, i {crew|plati|plati|platite} 20 srebrnjaka. Onda {crew|tvoje|tvoje|vaše} spremište"
" prima još dva sanduka."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/038_a_proper_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Planks of pine, split with wedges. Stack them well!"
msgstr "Borove daske, cijepane klinovima. {crew|Složi|Složi|Složite} ih dobro!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/038_a_proper_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Good iron! Now my wages."
msgstr "Dobro željezo! Sad mi još {crew|plati|plati|platite}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/038_a_proper_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Saw, plane, rivets... Look at her! Longer, wider, and room for two more crates."
msgstr ""
"Pila, blanja, zakovice... {crew|Pogledaj|Pogledaj|Pogledajte} ga! Duži, širi, i mjesta za još dva "
"sanduka."

