#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/050_the_first_snow/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The First Snow"
msgstr "Prvi snijeg"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/050_the_first_snow/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Snowflakes! Winter is near. Our store needs feed for the animals: six crates of hay and four of "
"grain. Your hold takes eight: think how to row it!"
msgstr ""
"Pahulje! Zima je blizu. Skladištu treba hrane za životinje: šest sanduka sijena i četiri žita. "
"{crew|Tvoje|Tvoje|Vaše} spremište prima osam: {crew|razmisli|razmisli|razmislite} kako to "
"prevesti!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/050_the_first_snow/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hay for the sheep, the goats and Rosa. Now the grain."
msgstr "Sijeno za ovce, koze i Rosu. Sad žito."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/050_the_first_snow/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The store is full! Let the snow come. Come in, the soup is hot."
msgstr "Skladište je puno! Neka dođe snijeg. {crew|Uđi|Uđi|Uđite}, čorba je vruća."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/050_the_first_snow/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "In winter, the animals stayed in the barn for months and ate the hay of the summer."
msgstr "Zimi su životinje mjesecima ostajale u štali i jele ljetno sijeno."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/051_the_ice_breaks/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Ice Breaks"
msgstr "Led puca"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/051_the_ice_breaks/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Hear that crack? The ice breaks: spring is here again! Row out and hail two boats: ask how "
"everybody got through the winter."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Čuješ|Čuješ|Čujete} li to pucketanje? Led puca: proljeće je opet tu! "
"{crew|Isplovi|Isplovi|Isplovite} i {crew|pozdravi|pozdravi|pozdravite} dva čamca: "
"{crew|pitaj|pitaj|pitajte} kako su svi prezimili."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/051_the_ice_breaks/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Everybody is well! But Tova has asked for you all winter. Row to Laxön!"
msgstr ""
"Svi su dobro! Ali Tova je cijelu zimu pitala za {crew|tebe|tebe|vas}. "
"{crew|Veslaj|Veslaj|Veslajte} na Laxön!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/051_the_ice_breaks/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A long winter! But the herring kept, thanks to your salt."
msgstr "Duga zima! Ali haringe su se sačuvale, zahvaljujući {crew|tvojoj|tvojoj|vašoj} soli."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/051_the_ice_breaks/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There you are! Spring is when the animals need us most. Will you be my apprentices, and learn to "
"heal?"
msgstr ""
"Tu {crew|si|si|ste}! Proljeće je vrijeme kad nas životinje najviše trebaju. {crew|Hoćeš li biti "
"moj učenik|Hoćeš li biti moja učenica|Hoćete li biti moji učenici|Hoćete li biti moje učenice} i "
"učiti liječiti?"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/051_the_ice_breaks/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "When the ice broke in spring, the boats came out, and with them the news."
msgstr "Kad bi se led u proljeće razbio, isplovili bi čamci, a s njima i vijesti."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/052_the_coughing_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Coughing Horse"
msgstr "Konj koji kašlje"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/052_the_coughing_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your first case as healers: Ragnfrid's old horse Bror coughs. Take him this syrup of thyme and "
"honey, then come back to me after a night, to hear how he is."
msgstr ""
"Prvi pravi slučaj: Ragnfridin stari konj Bror kašlje. {crew|Odnesi|Odnesi|Odnesite} mu ovaj sirup "
"od timijana i meda, pa mi se {crew|vrati|vrati|vratite} nakon jedne noći da "
"{crew|čuješ|čuješ|čujete} kako je."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/052_the_coughing_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Thyme and honey? Bror loves it. He licks the spoon!"
msgstr "Timijan i med? Bror to obožava. Oblizuje se!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/052_the_coughing_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "He slept the whole night and coughs no more. Tell Tova: her apprentices are good!"
msgstr ""
"Prespavao je cijelu noć i više ne kašlje. {crew|Reci|Reci|Recite} Tovi: njeni učenici su dobri!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/052_the_coughing_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Well done! You listened, you waited, you looked. That is healing."
