#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Barley in Spring"
msgstr "Ječam u proljeće"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The fields are dry: time to sow! Plant barley, and while it grows, sell two crates of eggs to Orm "
"in Hallvik to buy more seed."
msgstr ""
"Polja su suha: vrijeme je za sjetvu! {crew|Posij|Posij|Posijte} ječam, a dok raste, "
"{crew|prodaj|prodaj|prodajte} dva sanduka jaja Ormu u Hallviku, da kupimo još sjemena."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The barley is sown. Now the sun and the rain do the work."
msgstr "Ječam je posijan. Sad sunce i kiša rade svoje."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Eggs! I make my famous egg cake. Here, good silver for good eggs."
msgstr "Jaja! Pravim svoj čuveni kolač od jaja. Evo, dobro srebro za dobra jaja."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Barley was the most important grain of the north: for bread, porridge and ale."
msgstr "Ječam je bio najvažnije žito sjevera: za hljeb, kašu i pivo."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Great Hold"
msgstr "Veliko spremište"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Now we make your boat great! Ten planks from Frosttorp, three crates of tools, and 30 silver. Then"
" she takes two more crates. Ten planks are more than you can carry at once."
msgstr ""
"Sad ćemo {crew|tvoj|tvoj|vaš} čamac učiniti velikim! Deset dasaka iz Frosttorpa, tri sanduka alata"
" i 30 srebrnjaka. Onda prima još dva sanduka. Deset dasaka je više nego što "
"{crew|možeš|možeš|možete} ponijeti odjednom."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Planks again? Bjarne is building you a ship!"
msgstr "Opet daske? Bjarne {crew|ti|ti|vam} gradi brod!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Iron for the rivets. Now my wages."
msgstr "Željezo za zakovice. Sad mi još {crew|plati|plati|platite}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Two more crates! And go and see Signe in Ekvik: she builds real ships, and my crates go with you "
"into any of them."
msgstr ""
"Još dva sanduka! I {crew|svrati|svrati|svratite} do Signe u Ekviku: ona gradi prave brodove, a "
"moji sanduci idu s {crew|tobom|tobom|vama} u bilo koji od njih."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A knarr, the cargo ship of the vikings, could carry the load of twenty boats."
msgstr "Knar, teretni brod Vikinga, mogao je nositi teret dvadeset čamaca."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
