#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Canoe Race"
msgstr "Trka kanua"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Race us! Whoever touches the jetties of Ålberga, Dimmberga and Svanetorp first and comes back here"
" wins. Can you do it before the day ends?"
msgstr ""
"Trka s nama! Ko prvi dotakne pristaništa Ålberge, Dimmberge i Svanetorpa i vrati se ovamo, "
"pobjeđuje. {crew|Možeš li|Možeš li|Možete li} to prije kraja dana?"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ålberga: touched! The canoe is right behind you!"
msgstr "Ålberga: dotaknuta! Kanu je odmah iza {crew|tebe|tebe|vas}!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Dimmberga! Row, row, they are close!"
msgstr "Dimmberga! {crew|Veslaj, veslaj|Veslaj, veslaj|Veslajte, veslajte}, blizu su!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Svanetorp! Now back to Kråkhamn!"
msgstr "Svanetorp! Sad nazad u Kråkhamn!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You won! But only by a nose. Next time we win! Here, the prize: a honey cake each, and silver."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Pobijedio si|Pobijedila si|Pobijedili ste|Pobijedile ste}! Ali samo za nos. Idući put mi "
"pobjeđujemo! Evo nagrade: po jedan medeni kolač, i srebro."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Vikings loved contests: rowing, swimming, wrestling and running."
msgstr "Vikinzi su voljeli takmičenja: veslanje, plivanje, rvanje i trčanje."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/060_hilds_wedding/mission.json
