#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My horse Grane will not eat, and he is sad. Bring Tova to look at him, and take her home after."
msgstr ""
"Moj konj Grane ne jede i tužan je. {crew|Dovezi|Dovezi|Dovezite} Tovu da ga pogleda, a poslije je "
"{crew|odvezi|odvezi|odvezite} kući."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Tova: Just as I thought: a sore tooth. I file it smooth... There. Let him rest a night."
msgstr ""
"Tova: Baš kao što sam mislila: bolan zub. Sad ga brusim, glatko... Tako. Neka se odmori jednu noć."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Not eating? Let me see his teeth."
msgstr "Ne jede? Da mu vidim zube."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Back on my island. You were good assistants: soon you heal on your own."
msgstr ""
"Opet na svom otoku. {crew|Bio si dobar pomoćnik|Bila si dobra pomoćnica|Bili ste dobri "
"pomoćnici|Bile ste dobre pomoćnice}: uskoro {crew|ćeš liječiti sam|ćeš liječiti sama|ćete liječiti"
" sami|ćete liječiti same}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Grane eats like a wolf again! Take Tova home, with my thanks."
msgstr "Grane opet jede kao vuk! {crew|Odvezi|Odvezi|Odvezite} Tovu kući, uz moju zahvalnost."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Horses' teeth grow all their life; sometimes they must be filed smooth."
msgstr "Konjima zubi rastu cijeli život; ponekad ih treba izbrusiti."

