"sanduka medovine i četiri baklje od Orma iz Hallvika: {crew|tvoj|tvoj|vaš} čamac predvodi povorku!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/070_the_boat_procession/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Mead for after the procession. Now the torches."
msgstr "Medovina za poslije povorke. Sad baklje."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/070_the_boat_procession/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My best tar torches, from the ones you helped me make!"
msgstr ""
"Moje najbolje baklje od katrana, od onih {crew|koje si mi pomogao|koje si mi pomogla|koje ste mi "
