#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Healers' Round"
msgstr "Obilazak iscjelitelja"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You are ready. Do my round alone today: look at the lambs in Ålberga, the horses in Torsgården and"
" the swans in Svanetorp. Then come and tell me."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Spreman si|Spremna si|Spremni ste|Spremne ste}. {crew|Obiđi|Obiđi|Obiđite} danas "
"{crew|sam|sama|sami|same} moje bolesnike: {crew|pogledaj|pogledaj|pogledajte} janjad u Ålbergi, "
"konje u Torsgårdenu i labudove u Svanetorpu. Onda {crew|dođi|dođi|dođite} i "
"{crew|ispričaj|ispričaj|ispričajte} mi."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "You look in their eyes, their ears, their hooves... All well? Good! They like you."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Gledaš|Gledaš|Gledate} im u oči, uši, kopita... Sve u redu? Dobro! Vole {crew|te|te|vas}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bror is old, but well. Silke's new foal is strong. Tell Tova all is fine."
msgstr ""
"Bror je star, ali dobro je. Silkino novo ždrijebe je snažno. {crew|Reci|Reci|Recite} Tovi da je "
"sve u redu."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The swans? Fat and happy. One has a sore wing: you wrapped it well."
msgstr ""
"Labudovi? Debeli i zadovoljni. Jedan ima bolno krilo: {crew|dobro si ga previo|dobro si ga "
"previla|dobro ste ga previli|dobro ste ga previle}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"All well, and the swan's wing wrapped? Then take this: your own healer's bag. You are healers now."
msgstr ""
"Sve u redu, i labudovo krilo previjeno? Onda {crew|uzmi|uzmi|uzmite} ovo: {crew|tvoja|tvoja|vaša} "
"vlastita torba iscjelitelja. Sad {crew|si iscjelitelj|si iscjeliteljica|ste iscjelitelji|ste "
"iscjeliteljice}."

#. a gift for a task: 'You get ...'
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "your own healer's bag"
msgstr "vlastita torba iscjelitelja"

#. the thing 'your own healer's bag' for {thing@acc} in the translations: the accusative (the direct
#. object), e.g. 'бочку эля', 'bačvu piva'; leave it empty if it is the same as the plain
#. translation
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "acc"
msgid "your own healer's bag"
msgstr "vlastitu torbu iscjelitelja"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Healers looked, listened and touched: they had no tools but their hands and their herbs."
msgstr "Iscjelitelji su gledali, slušali i dodirivali: nisu imali alata osim svojih ruku i bilja."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/082_the_colt_in_the_mud/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Colt in the Mud"
msgstr "Ždrijebe u blatu"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/082_the_colt_in_the_mud/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Silke's colt ran into the bog and is stuck to his belly! I need a long rope: Tor in Stormvik has "
"the longest. Hurry, he is scared!"
msgstr ""
"Silkino ždrijebe utrčalo je u močvaru i zaglavilo se do trbuha! Treba mi dugo uže: Tor u Stormviku"
" ima najduže. {crew|Požuri|Požuri|Požurite}, prestrašeno je!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/082_the_colt_in_the_mud/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Rope around him, gently, everybody pull... Slurp! He is out! Muddy, but well. You saved him."
msgstr ""
"Uže oko njega, nježno, svi vucite... Šljap! Izašlo je! Blatnjavo, ali dobro. {crew|Spasio si "
"ga|Spasila si ga|Spasili ste ga|Spasile ste ga}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/082_the_colt_in_the_mud/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My longest rope! Take it, quick!"
msgstr "Moje najduže uže! {crew|Uzmi|Uzmi|Uzmite} ga, brzo!"

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/082_the_colt_in_the_mud/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Rope"
msgstr "Uže"

