#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/082_the_colt_in_the_mud/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A horse stuck in mud must be pulled out slowly, or it hurts its legs."
msgstr "Konja zaglavljenog u blatu treba izvlačiti polako, inače se ozlijedi."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/083_grain_for_the_north/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Grain for the North"
msgstr "Žito za sjever"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/083_grain_for_the_north/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My hunters send news: the summer in the north was cold, and their families have no grain. My ship "
"leaves in three days: fill it with twelve crates!"
msgstr ""
"Moji lovci javljaju: ljeto na sjeveru bilo je hladno, i njihove porodice nemaju žita. Moj brod "
"polazi za tri dana: {crew|napuni|napuni|napunite} ga s dvanaest sanduka!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/083_grain_for_the_north/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Twelve crates! Nobody in the north goes hungry this winter. The whole valley thanks you."
msgstr ""
"Dvanaest sanduka! Niko na sjeveru neće gladovati ove zime. Cijela dolina {crew|ti|ti|vam} "
"zahvaljuje."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/083_grain_for_the_north/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "When the harvest failed, the farms helped each other: next year, it might be them."
msgstr ""
"Kad bi žetva podbacila, imanja su pomagala jedna drugima: sljedeće godine pomoć je mogla trebati "
"njima."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/084_the_wool_fair/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Wool Fair"
msgstr "Sajam vune"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/084_the_wool_fair/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The wool fair! Traders come from the Long Lake to buy. Bring me eight crates of wool, the more the"
" better, and the fair is a success."
msgstr ""
"Sajam vune! Trgovci dolaze s Dugog jezera da kupuju. {crew|Donesi|Donesi|Donesite} mi osam sanduka"
" vune, što više to bolje, i sajam je uspio."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/084_the_wool_fair/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Eight crates! The traders from the Long Lake ask: who are these girls? I say: the best traders of "
"the Home Lakes."
msgstr ""
"Osam sanduka! Trgovci s Dugog jezera pitaju: ko {crew|je ovaj dječak|je ova djevojčica|su ova "
"djeca|su ove djevojčice}? Kažem: {crew|najbolji trgovac|najbolja trgovkinja|najbolji "
"trgovci|najbolje trgovkinje} Domaćih jezera."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/084_the_wool_fair/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Wool was so important that some sagas tell of whole ships full of it."
msgstr "Vuna je bila toliko važna da neke sage pričaju o cijelim brodovima punim vune."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Goats on the Island"
msgstr "Koze na otoku"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My four goats swam to Bergö! They eat Dagny's flowers, and she is cross. Bring them back before "
"they eat her kiln too!"
msgstr ""
"Moje četiri koze preplivale su na Bergö! Jedu Dagnyno cvijeće, a ona je ljuta. "
"{crew|Vrati|Vrati|Vratite} ih prije nego što pojedu i njenu peć!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My naughty goats! Tomorrow I build a higher fence. Here, my best cheese."
msgstr "Moje nestašne koze! Sutra gradim višu ogradu. Evo, moj najbolji sir."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Take them, take them! They ate my flowers and a basket and a shoe!"
msgstr ""
"{crew|Nosi|Nosi|Nosite} ih, {crew|nosi|nosi|nosite}! Pojele su mi cvijeće i košaru i cipelu!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Goats are good swimmers when they must be, and they eat nearly anything."
msgstr "Koze dobro plivaju kad moraju, i jedu gotovo sve."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "News for Everybody"
msgstr "Vijesti za sve"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Big news: a ship from the Long Lake will come, and the way between the lakes opens! Tell the "
"smith, the fishers of Stormvik and Orm in Hallvik. I tell the rest."
msgstr ""
"Velike vijesti: stiže brod s Dugog jezera, i otvara se put između jezera! {crew|Javi|Javi|Javite} "
"kovaču, ribarima u Stormviku i Ormu u Hallviku. Ostalima javljam ja."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A ship from the Long Lake? They will want my iron!"
msgstr "Brod s Dugog jezera? Sigurno će tražiti moje željezo!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "New lakes, new fish! Thank you for telling us."
msgstr ""
"Nova jezera, nova riba! Hvala što {crew|si nam javio|si nam javila|ste nam javili|ste nam javile}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Guests from far away! I must brew more. Thank you, girls!"
msgstr "Gosti izdaleka! Moram napraviti još piva. Hvala, {crew|momče|djevojčice|djeco|djevojčice}!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The lakes of the north were joined by rivers and portages, where boats were dragged over land."
msgstr ""
"Jezera na sjeveru bila su spojena rijekama i stazama preko kojih su se čamci vukli po kopnu."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/087_a_cow_for_grim/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A Cow for Grim"
msgstr "Krava za Grima"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/087_a_cow_for_grim/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I am old, and I would like fresh milk every morning. Bring me a cow from the horse farm. The swans"
" will be jealous!"
msgstr ""
"Star sam, i volio bih svako jutro svježe mlijeko. {crew|Dovedi|Dovedi|Dovedite} mi kravu s ergele."
" Labudovi će biti ljubomorni!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/087_a_cow_for_grim/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A cow! I call her Swan, ha. Here, for your trouble, and for all the years you visited an old man."
msgstr ""
"Krava! Zove se Labudica, ha. Evo, za trud, i za sve godine što {crew|si posjećivao|si "
"posjećivala|ste posjećivali|ste posjećivale} starca."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/087_a_cow_for_grim/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A good cow gave milk for ten years or more, and was part of the family."
msgstr "Dobra krava davala je mlijeko deset godina ili više, i bila je dio porodice."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/088_flowers_on_the_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Flowers on the Hill"
msgstr "Cvijeće na brdu"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/088_flowers_on_the_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Plant flowers on the sunny hill! When they bloom, bring three crates to Gudrun's inn: she wants "
"the inn to smell like summer."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Posadi|Posadi|Posadite} cvijeće na sunčanom brdu! Kad procvjeta, "
"{crew|odnesi|odnesi|odnesite} tri sanduka u Gudruninu krčmu: želi da krčma miriše na ljeto."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/088_flowers_on_the_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Flower seeds in the earth. In two days, they bloom."
msgstr "Sjeme cvijeća je u zemlji. Za dva dana će procvjetati."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/088_flowers_on_the_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Flowers on every table! The guests smile. Here is your silver, and a cup of milk for each of you."
msgstr ""
"Cvijeće na svakom stolu! Gosti se smiješe. Evo {crew|tvog|tvog|vašeg} srebra, i čaša mlijeka za "
"{crew|tebe|tebe|svakog od vas|svaku od vas}."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/088_flowers_on_the_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Vikings wove flowers into wreaths and crowns for feasts and weddings."
msgstr "Vikinzi su pleli cvijeće u vijence i krune za gozbe i svadbe."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/089_the_pottery_market/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Pottery Market"
msgstr "Sajam lonaca"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/089_the_pottery_market/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The new kiln makes so many pots! Bring ten crates to the market in Kråkhamn. Ten crates: only your"
" big boat can do it."
msgstr ""
"Nova peć pravi toliko lonaca! {crew|Odnesi|Odnesi|Odnesite} deset sanduka na trg u Kråkhamnu. "
"Deset sanduka: samo {crew|tvoj|tvoj|vaš} veliki čamac to može."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/089_the_pottery_market/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ten crates of Dagny's pots, and not one broken! The best rowing of the lakes."
msgstr "Deset sanduka Dagnynih lonaca, i nijedan razbijen! Najbolje veslanje na jezerima."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/089_the_pottery_market/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Pack them in straw: pots do not like to bump!"
msgstr "{crew|Složi|Složi|Složite} ih u slamu: lonci ne vole udarce!"

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/089_the_pottery_market/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Pots"
msgstr "Lonci"

