msgstr "Rub šume"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/091_the_edge_of_the_forest/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Kol and Ingrid want sheep for their new home. Bring them two sheep, and I give you the strip of "
"land by the forest, next to your farm. A fair trade!"
msgstr ""
"Kol i Ingrid žele ovce za svoj novi dom. {crew|Donesi|Donesi|Donesite} im dvije ovce, a ja ću "
"{crew|ti|ti|vam} dati pojas zemlje uz šumu, pored {crew|tvog|tvog|vašeg} imanja. Pošten posao!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/091_the_edge_of_the_forest/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Two sheep for the young ones! Ingrid already knits. The forest edge is yours: good wood and two "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"Dvije ovce za mlade! Ingrid već plete. Rub šume je {crew|tvoj|tvoj|vaš}: dobro drvo i dva polja."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/091_the_edge_of_the_forest/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Land was traded for animals, silver or work: there were no banks."
msgstr "Zemlja se mijenjala za životinje, srebro ili rad: banaka nije bilo."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/092_the_longhouse_grows/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Longhouse Grows"
msgstr "Dugačka kuća raste"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/092_the_longhouse_grows/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"With so many animals and friends, our house is too small! Bring twelve logs from Frosttorp, two "
"crates of tools and two pots of tar, and we make it longer."
msgstr ""
"S toliko životinja i prijatelja naša kuća je premala! {crew|Donesi|Donesi|Donesite} dvanaest "
"trupaca iz Frosttorpa, dva sanduka alata i dva lonca katrana, pa ćemo je produžiti."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/092_the_longhouse_grows/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Twelve logs! Fill that big hold of yours."
msgstr "Dvanaest trupaca! {crew|Napuni|Napuni|Napunite} to svoje veliko spremište."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/092_the_longhouse_grows/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Axes and nails. Now the tar for the roof."
msgstr "Sjekire i čavli. Sad katran za krov."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/092_the_longhouse_grows/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hammering all night with the neighbours... Our longhouse is twice as long! Room for a feast."
msgstr ""
"Cijelu noć smo čekićali sa susjedima... Naša dugačka kuća je dvostruko duža! Ima mjesta za gozbu."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/092_the_longhouse_grows/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A longhouse could be made longer by adding a piece at the end, like a train."
msgstr "Dugačka kuća mogla se produžiti dodavanjem novog dijela na kraju, kao vagon."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/093_the_green_valley/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Green Valley"
msgstr "Zelena dolina"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/093_the_green_valley/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You helped my valley all year. The green valley behind your farm has no owner: bring me two crates"
" of cloth and two of honey for the gods' feast, and it is yours."
msgstr ""
"Cijelu godinu {crew|si pomagao|si pomagala|ste pomagali|ste pomagale} mojoj dolini. Zelena dolina "
"iza {crew|tvog|tvog|vašeg} imanja nema vlasnika: {crew|donesi|donesi|donesite} mi dva sanduka "
"tkanine i dva meda za gozbu bogova, i {crew|tvoja|tvoja|vaša} je."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/093_the_green_valley/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cloth for the hall. Now the honey."
msgstr "Tkanina za dvoranu. Sad med."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/093_the_green_valley/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Father says it at the Thing, in front of everybody: the green valley belongs to Ylva and Sigrid!"
msgstr "Otac je to rekao na Tingu, pred svima: zelena dolina pripada Ylvi i Sigrid!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/093_the_green_valley/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "At the Thing, the meeting of the free people, land and laws were decided."
msgstr "Na Tingu, skupu slobodnih ljudi, odlučivalo se o zemlji i zakonima."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/094_bees_for_the_valley/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bees for the Valley"
