#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/094_bees_for_the_valley/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The valley is full of clover and heather. Bees would love it! Have three beehives on the farm, and"
" we will have honey all year."
msgstr ""
"Dolina je puna djeteline i vrijeska. Pčele bi je obožavale! {crew|Nabavi|Nabavi|Nabavite} tri "
"košnice za imanje, pa ćemo imati med cijele godine."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/094_bees_for_the_valley/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hum, hum, hum! Three hives in the valley. Honey for us, and for mead."
msgstr "Zum, zum, zum! Tri košnice u dolini. Med za nas, i za medovinu."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/094_bees_for_the_valley/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Heather honey is dark and strong; clover honey is light and mild."
msgstr "Med od vrijeska je taman i jak; med od djeteline je svijetao i blag."

